// SearchUnitDiff Get the difference between two Revisions of many Units across spaces
//
// Returns, for every Unit the where clause selects, across every Space in the organization, what changed in its configuration between the Revision from names and the Revision to names, path by path with the values on both sides. This is the bulk counterpart of the single-Unit diff subresource. from and to must each pick out a Revision in every Unit: HeadRevisionNum, LastReleasedRevisionNum, Tag:<id>, ChangeSet:<id>, ChangeOrder:<id> or Release:<id>, optionally prefixed with Before:. A Unit with no Revision a side names is absent on that side, and its diff runs against nothing. Scope it to one Space with a where clause.
