// AttestWithBodyWithResponse Record Attestations across Spaces
//
// Record an Attestation in each Space selected by WhereSpace, SpaceFilterID, ChangeOrderID and TargetStage, covering one Revision of each Unit WhereUnit selects there, named by Revision. When ChangeOrderID is given it defaults to the Revision a Release of the change would bundle, which the ChangeOrder's release Tag marks, or to the one its end Tag marks for a Unit the release Tag does not mark, so the approval satisfies its entry and release gates alike; it defaults to the head Revision otherwise. Each Space is recorded on its own and reported on its own.
